  "_source": "claude-code 2.1.245: `tengu_api_success` per-request success emission, including the main-query `querySource` allowlist (`repl_main_thread` / `sdk`). Budget-threshold events (tengu_cost_budget_warning/exceeded) retain the M3 basis-point thresholds.",
